      {
        "id": 194330,
        "name": "bolnerap",
        "username": "bolnerap",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-31T02:20:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a slightly easier time with this. The only reason I didn't end with everyone in the 20s was a last-round Explosives Barrel that went off because Elemental Storm hit a full-health Cryo Bot ('sup 4 damage to everything). On the plus side, that Explosives Barrel killed off four Golems, each of which triggered Volatile Parts twice, so Unity + Explosives Barrel took the Ennead from 5 active members down to 1 on the villain's own turn.&nbsp;</p><p>The biggest problem I ran into with this team was Osiris. While the discarding works well with TN Unity's base power, it most certainly does not work well with Crit Multiplier. I ended up doing bonus damage to myself with all four characters thanks to Champion Bot, Wounding Buffer, Turret Mode, and Critical Multiplier. Even with all that, Nuit at the start, and a double Rise to Power, we won with CC at 8 HP, Parse at 13, TN Bunker at 14, and TN Unity at 12.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
